# Source material for the salary grid — the MMFTSS workbook, the draft annexes,
# ~5 MB of .docx/.xlsx/.pdf. Out of the repo; `data/salarii/` below carries what
# was parsed out of them, which is what the site actually reads.
docs/salarii/

# The salary grid registry is a versioned artifact, not scratch output: every
# estimate the site shows must be traceable to a row in it, including for an
# older variant of the draft law. Rebuild with `python build-salary-grid.py`.
!/data/salarii/
# The COR occupation table is reference data with a recorded provenance, not
# pipeline output. See data/ocupatii/README.md.
!/data/ocupatii/
# Town populations, 2021 census (DATA-06): reference data with its source and
# revision in every row. Rebuild with ops/build-uat-population.py.
!/data/uat-populatie.csv
